(f) Special Mission Unit (SMU) Troop Commander
(g) Corps/Division Intel Planner (SAMS utilization only)', 'ea2df15c09255935d46d4497b539268640a4c59549818053a43cd1e5af5f9f4c', 5, 5, '5', 32, null, null, false, null),
  ('9a49c9b0-9e24-526d-9535-ae4a6c996866', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'assignments', 'O-4', null, 'Major development — Broadening assignments', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'Military Intelligence majors should strive to have a broad base of intelligence experience at various echelons. Following their successful KD assignment(s), MI majors should serve in a balance of division, echelon at or above corps, and joint assignments. Experience at multiple echelons will assist Military Intelligence majors at the next rank.', '11896888a6aa0f3c5ee6c50162b928223677cbefb033839166351469934cbf6d', 5, 5, '5', 33, null, null, false, null),
  ('e7c944a8-3b6c-51fa-9216-9aa9a9f56fa0', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'self_development', 'O-4', null, 'Major development — Self-development', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'Majors should actively pursue self-development opportunities to fully master all aspects of operations including tactical and JIIM operations. Self-development includes studying doctrine, correspondence courses, civilian education, and institutional training. Military Intelligence majors should consider publication in academic and professional journals, as it will encourage Military Intelligence majors to critically develop their thoughts for a wide and discriminating audience.', '3d3de88e460aad01cbb633ff3ca4c4859821550bf6616e1868e5925554b5feb0', 5, 5, '5', 34, null, null, false, null),
  ('df69a62b-22be-537e-903f-c5a06657503d', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'training', 'O-5', null, 'Lieutenant Colonel development — Education', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'Military Intelligence lieutenant colonels are encouraged to complete JPMEII.', '80fedf6edd7c21ed59ec0f93e645eb56537da4ec756a8f5ebc3041be4eded53d', 5, 5, '5', 35, null, null, false, null),
  ('ae98e331-9ef8-57d0-a169-1e69e3e50503', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'assignments', 'O-5', null, 'Lieutenant Colonel development — Key developmental assignments', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'All 35B assignments are KD for 35B lieutenant colonels. These positions consist of more intelligence managerial assignments across the theater, national, joint, and interagency communities. At this echelon, 35Bs direct and synchronize interagency intelligence activities overseeing the strategic intelligence planning, collection, and analysis apparatus.', '58a976ef07c0bb8a9f8790c533519b9fc477da143b7d566758423d52def03c5b', 5, 5, '5', 36, null, null, false, null),
  ('9d8aaef2-d7db-5416-a711-f3e1cbd3f17e', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'development', 'O-5', null, 'Lieutenant Colonel development — Additional guidance', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'The following are KD assignments for 35A Military Intelligence lieutenant colonels, including any assignment identified on the Centralized Selection List – Key Billet (CSL-KB) Slate:
(a) Division/Multi-Domain Task Force (MDTF) G2
(b) Battalion Commander
(c) Corps or higher ACE Chief / JISE Chief', 'abf048c677b926115f59f9034678bd939e61ee3f637fba5c40c68c65dd0596ab', 5, 6, '5', 37, null, null, false, null),
  ('befae279-cb72-5975-8e10-a9fa547561ae', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'assignments', 'O-5', null, 'Lieutenant Colonel development — Broadening assignments', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'Officers selected for lieutenant colonel and CSL positions must seek assignments within the branch that directly contribute to and develop the Army intelligence profession. Lieutenant colonels serve at multiple echelons and types of positions throughout their career. Lieutenant colonels should seek the opportunity for joint qualification and intelligence broadening assignments.', '500c5e262ef401c0da191f7aedb49c1a7826e7966d2e5bb2dee8a8cca2feeac4', 6, 6, '6', 38, null, null, false, null),
  ('30b42a97-9937-5487-a127-1ad7321b527e', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'self_development', 'O-5', null, 'Lieutenant Colonel development — Self-development', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'Lieutenant colonels must actively pursue self-development opportunities to fully master aspects of operations including continued performance at multiple echelons.', '5592334c2cc9595d23ffd9556ee54812d0105634464918a2bd875fccbdbfded8', 6, 6, '6', 39, null, null, false, null),
  ('b4d6dadd-ff1c-52e1-a692-8d4df486e762', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'training', 'O-6', null, 'Colonel development — Education', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'Successful completion of a JPME II certificate through the Senior Service College (SSC) or the successful completion of a JPME II level producing course.', '0ee15e301e7ed2d026933b2965122ff93d24ec8fe8291395f90dad68718faf26', 6, 6, '6', 40, null, null, false, null),
  ('3e9867f1-a985-5007-a4f4-beb1a377f2e4', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'assignments', 'O-6', null, 'Colonel development — Key developmental assignments', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'All 35B assignments are KD for 35B colonels. . These positions consist of JIOC Commanders, National Agency and CCMD Division Chiefs, and Branch Heads. At this echelon, 35Bs lead strategic intelligence organizations and direct comprehensive global intelligence portfolios. They apply regional, functional, and institutional mastery to govern multi-agency intelligence architectures and synchronize complex intelligence activities.', '73fa6847e28144f11562d40db820dcf4b6d2b96fc4c6038caa972f082799b345', 6, 6, '6', 41, null, null, false, null),
  ('609c5e3b-911c-5644-b09d-5f951fddd66b', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'development', 'O-6', null, 'Colonel development — Additional guidance', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', '35A Colonels contribute to the branch by serving in critical KD assignments, including any assignment identified on the Centralized Selection List – Key Billet (CSL-KB):
(a) Corps G2
(b) Brigade Commander
(c) Transformation & Lessons Learned Integrator (TLLM) (former ACM)
(d) Army Service Component Command / Army Command or higher G2/J2
(e) Chief of Staff', '5ecd3a4b32921eb0d907aea374457c9c82da1074b031156a6d616b913c63b982', 6, 6, '6', 42, null, null, false, null),
  ('93767589-0915-515b-83ef-bb5197b38398', '17bcb58b-b351-5a99-9642-66274f5df836', 'Army', 'officer', '35B', 'STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE OFFICER', 'assignments', 'O-6', null, 'Colonel development — Broadening assignments', 'Military Intelligence Branch officer career pamphlet, DA PAM 600-3 chapter (August 2026)', 'Officers selected for colonel and CSL positions must seek assignments that directly contribute to and develop the Army intelligence profession.', '15661017142de728cbcfb116ce7dc92bdb36d8a4179bf7ed676dcdfbd5a7a703', 6, 6, '6', 43, null, null, false, null);
